; One variable: `layout_direction = 3` on the lower TabBar. Under RTL a TabBar draws each tab at
; `size.width - ofs_cache - size_cache` (tab_bar.cpp:552,1929) and flows its icon, title and close
; icon back from `size_cache - the style's LEFT margin` (:660,668,676,721): the left margin
; measured off the right edge, so `tab_selected` gets a lopsided 24/6 override.

