; The first tab's inline GradientTexture2D is asymmetric along X, so a mirrored icon differs from
; an unmirrored one, and `tab_close_display_policy = 2` keeps a close icon trailing every tab. Both
; bars anchor to one symmetric rect, so only the inside of the strip can move.
; `unit-tab-bar-rtl-scroll` moves the scroll arrows, and every other TabBar scene is LTR.
